error[E0277]: `Signed<65>` is not an admitted slot range
  --> tests/ui/word_length_past_the_ladder.rs:14:14
   |
14 |     let _ = <Fi<65, 32> as Format>::PHASE;
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^ no slot range exists for this width
   |
   = help: the trait `Slots` is not implemented for `Signed<65>`
   = note: this crate implements the trait at widths 1 to 64, the widest pointer width a target has and the widest carrier the placement ladder offers. The trait is open, so another crate may implement it at a range of its own; what such an implementor owes is the `ADMITTED` obligation.
   = help: the following other types implement trait `Slots`:
             Signed<10>
             Signed<11>
             Signed<12>
             Signed<13>
             Signed<14>
             Signed<15>
             Signed<16>
             Signed<17>
           and $N others
   = note: required for `Fi<65, 32>` to implement `Format`
